= Question and approach

Entry 08 costed each workload on every batch model. This report adds a quality estimate per workload and asks which models are worth their price. Signals were kept small on purpose: two open sources, one to three signals per workload, chosen from benchmarks that already score most current models. Better-fitting benchmarks with thin or stale coverage were left out (section 5).

