*Artificial Analysis was not used.* It has better-fitting evals (IFBench, AA-LCR long context, GPQA, HLE, tau2), but its API needs a free key and its terms forbid scraping. No key existed in Infisical or 1Password on 2026-10-31. Adding one is the single biggest upgrade available (section 5).

